Hy2Scale - Decentralized Hysteria2 Relay Network

Features:
- Hysteria2 QUIC tunnel relay
- L2TP/IPsec, IKEv2, OpenVPN and WireGuard VPN servers (userspace)
- SOCKS5/HTTP/Shadowsocks/Trojan proxies
- Policy sets for routing by user, destination, domain or country
- Per-user exits, traffic limits and rate limits
- Web management UI

Usage:
1. Access https://<device-ip>:<web-port>/scale/ after installation (self-signed certificate by default)
2. Default username: admin, set password on first login
3. Add relay nodes on the Nodes page
4. Add VPN users on the Users page
5. Enable L2TP/IKEv2/OpenVPN on the Proxies page, WireGuard on the Endpoints page
